    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5cf6a9e848147cb8",
      "translationZh": "安全政策的列举与说明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a200b31c27ebfbcf",
      "translationZh": "可选的模型回复：同样用 <start_of_turn> 和 <end_of_turn> 控制标记包裹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cbbd6fc3c535a667",
      "translationZh": "结尾说明：要求模型对文本进行分类。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b908c24f83c57e1c",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个用于评估用户提示词 [User Prompt] 的提示词示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4c7901bd8ba12de",
      "translationZh": "以下列出了一些你可能希望纳入工作流程的安全原则示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
